      "startMs": 4119,
      "endMs": 10467,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "所以不能再把当前位置作为未来交叉加入清单。",
      "startMs": 10909,
      "endMs": 14668,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "ES23": [
    {
      "text": "差为负，交点在当前位置左侧，已经经过，不加入未来清单。",
      "startMs": 70,
      "endMs": 5878,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
