      "startMs": 6389,
      "endMs": 9460,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "分别拿两条线段各自某个端点的高度比较，不能代替扫描线处的高低。",
      "startMs": 9809,
      "endMs": 15240,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "ES29": [
    {
      "text": "把正在比较的两份非竖直输入仍叫 S₁、S₂，编号由下标一、二区分。",
      "startMs": 70,
      "endMs": 6418,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "沿用上集按它们端点算出的直线系数 a_i、b_i、c_i。",
      "startMs": 6869,
      "endMs": 11389,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "这些是已知固定数，不为高度比较重新拟合近似直线。",
      "startMs": 11889,
      "endMs": 16438,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "ES30": [
