      "startMs": 5129,
      "endMs": 8068,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "这只是把已证明的一般结论接到精确系数上，不用一个数值案例代替证明。",
      "startMs": 8529,
      "endMs": 14268,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    }
  ],
  "ES41": [
